# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Locally provisioned toolchains. Never belongs in the repo: an unpacked SDK is
# hundreds of megabytes and exceeds GitHub's per-file limit outright.
#
# These are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored `flutter/`
# matches a directory of that name at *any* depth, which silently swallowed
# every new file under bindings/flutter/ -- already-tracked files kept working,
# so nothing looked wrong until someone added a source file and git quietly
# refused to stage it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.dart-tmp/
/.toolchains/
/android-ndk-*/
/flutter/
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
Thumbs.db

# Cache directory created by core/examples/hello_flm when run from the repo root
hello_flm_data/
